ing for a second term that's  notable because if he wins in november  he'd be 77 the oldest person ever  elected president  and he's never gone quite as far in  suggesting he'd be up for it again  in 2024 one other note this morning the  binding campaign says  27 former gop lawmakers are now  endorsing the former vice president's  campaign  they include senator former senator jeff  flake of arizona and former senator  john warner of virginia gail all of this  coming of course the morning that the  republican convention  is set to begin yeah it's another late  night for all of us  you too ed o'keefe i'll be watching  can't wait thank you very much ed  always good to see you
 

